{
  "name": "read-swc-element",
  "description": "A generic `read` at element granularity. It replaces `read_swc` without naming the layer in the operation, and answers in exactly the field vocabulary `discover` declared, so a `create` or `update` can be written against the answer without translation.",
  "kind": "example",
  "context": {
    "summary": "The `examples/basic` model. `ExampleSWC` is stored under the `example` group, provides `pOut` on `IExample`, runs `ExampleRun` on a 10 ms timing event and consumes 2048 bytes of the `RAM0` memory.",
